<h1>Free GitHub alternatives to monthly-subscription tools: <span class="mark">a preview</span></h1>
<p class="lead">I'm putting together free GitHub tools that do a similar job to popular monthly-subscription tools. Here are 3 of the ones I actually installed.</p>
<p class="notice">Checked on Nov 1, 2026 · &ldquo;Alternative&rdquo; here means &ldquo;a tool that does a similar job,&rdquo; not &ldquo;the same features.&rdquo;</p>

<h2>How to read the install difficulty</h2>
<p class="legend">⭐ click only · ⭐⭐ follow the steps · ⭐⭐⭐ needs the terminal · 💀 gave up</p>

